---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Start([vigilo coordinator once])

    CoordinatorId[Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id]
    Database{Database context available?}
    Controls[Claim deliveries through restricted function; apply and observe quiescence]
    SettleControls[Claim quiescent revocations through restricted function and retry cleanup]
    RecoverCreation[Discover accepted ready plans and acquire fenced admission lease]
    ReadPlan[Verify immutable roots, configuration and gate counts]
    AdmitPlan[Replay compact admission and verify coverage]
    CreationDeferred[Release ownership and continue bounded candidates]
    RecoveryCatalog{Execution placement catalog available?}
    RecoveryPlacement{Execution placements remain?}
    Recover[Restricted expired-lease discovery and movement locks; recheck ownership and recover]
    RecoveryIsolated[Classify failure, count it, and skip alias]
    DispatchClaim{Restricted cursor claim returned a route?}
    DispatchRun[Start run if needed and enqueue shard chunk window]
    DispatchIsolated[Leave cursor open and exclude alias for this pass]
    FinalizeCandidate{Restricted discovery finds candidate within budget?}
    ReadSummaries[Read candidate summaries in one batch per database]
    FinalizeClaim{Candidate has exact valid seals?}
    FinalizeRun[Restricted lease claim; roll up counts, set gate, and enqueue completion event]
    FinalizeIsolated[Defer run and retain healthy summary reads]
    Aggregate[Discover ready shards with bounded database and shard concurrency]
    AggregationBudget{Ready page and database scheduling budgets available?}
    AggregationPage[Try claim and atomically commit one bounded receipt or canonical page]
    AggregationNext[Visit unchecked candidates before revisiting shards with ready work]
    AggregationDrain[Await all admitted page operations under database deadlines]
    Messaging{Messaging context available?}
    OutboxCatalog{Outbox placement catalog available?}
    OutboxPlacement{Database placements remain?}
    ClaimOutbox[Claim publishable delivery rows through restricted function]
    Events{Claimed delivery rows remain?}
    BrokerCircuit{Messaging circuit admits publish?}
    Publish[Publish event to queue with bounded concurrency]
    PublishResult{Publish succeeded?}
    MarkPublished[Mark ledger published and delete delivery row]
    Reschedule[Reschedule delivery row for retry]
    OutboxIsolated[Classify failure, count it, and skip alias]
    Stats[Log cycle statistics]

    Success([Success response])

    ContextFail([Runtime context error])
    RecoveryFail([Recovery persistence error])
    DispatchFail([Dispatch persistence error])
    FinalizeFail([Finalization persistence error])
    OutboxFail([Outbox persistence error])

    Start --> CoordinatorId
    CoordinatorId --> Database

    Database -- No --> ContextFail
    Database -- Yes --> Controls --> SettleControls --> RecoverCreation

    RecoverCreation --> ReadPlan --> AdmitPlan --> RecoveryCatalog
    ReadPlan -. Unavailable or invalid object .-> CreationDeferred
    AdmitPlan -. Candidate fails .-> CreationDeferred
    CreationDeferred --> RecoveryCatalog
    RecoverCreation -. Recovery fails .-> RecoveryFail

    RecoveryCatalog -- No --> RecoveryFail
    RecoveryCatalog -- Yes --> RecoveryPlacement
    RecoveryPlacement -- Yes --> Recover
    RecoveryPlacement -- No --> DispatchClaim
    Recover --> RecoveryPlacement
    Recover -. Placement operation fails .-> RecoveryIsolated
    RecoveryIsolated --> RecoveryPlacement

    DispatchClaim -- Yes --> DispatchRun
    DispatchClaim -- No or batch limit reached --> Aggregate
    Aggregate --> AggregationBudget
    AggregationBudget -- Yes --> AggregationPage --> AggregationNext --> AggregationBudget
    AggregationBudget -- No --> AggregationDrain --> FinalizeCandidate

    DispatchRun --> DispatchClaim
    DispatchRun -. Execution placement fails .-> DispatchIsolated
    DispatchRun -. Control update fails .-> DispatchFail
    DispatchIsolated --> DispatchClaim

    FinalizeCandidate -- Yes --> ReadSummaries --> FinalizeClaim
    FinalizeCandidate -- No --> Messaging
    FinalizeClaim -- Yes --> FinalizeRun
    FinalizeClaim -- No --> FinalizeIsolated

    ReadSummaries -. Placement unavailable .-> FinalizeIsolated
    FinalizeRun --> FinalizeCandidate
    FinalizeRun -. Control update fails .-> FinalizeFail
    FinalizeIsolated --> FinalizeCandidate

    Messaging -- No --> ContextFail
    Messaging -- Yes --> OutboxCatalog

    OutboxCatalog -- No --> OutboxFail
    OutboxCatalog -- Yes --> OutboxPlacement
    OutboxPlacement -- Yes --> ClaimOutbox
    OutboxPlacement -- No --> Stats

    ClaimOutbox --> Events
    ClaimOutbox -. Placement operation fails .-> OutboxIsolated

    Events -- Yes --> BrokerCircuit
    Events -- No --> OutboxPlacement

    BrokerCircuit -- Open --> Reschedule
    BrokerCircuit -- Closed or probe --> Publish
    Publish --> PublishResult

    PublishResult -- Yes --> MarkPublished
    PublishResult -- No --> Reschedule

    MarkPublished --> Events
    MarkPublished -. Placement operation fails .-> OutboxIsolated

    Reschedule --> Events
    Reschedule -. Placement operation fails .-> OutboxIsolated

    OutboxIsolated --> OutboxPlacement

    Stats --> Success

    class Start command
    class Success success
    class CoordinatorId,Database,Controls,SettleControls,RecoverCreation,ReadPlan,AdmitPlan,CreationDeferred,RecoveryCatalog,RecoveryPlacement,Recover,RecoveryIsolated,DispatchClaim,DispatchRun,DispatchIsolated,FinalizeCandidate,ReadSummaries,FinalizeClaim,FinalizeRun,FinalizeIsolated,Aggregate,AggregationBudget,AggregationPage,AggregationNext,AggregationDrain,Messaging,OutboxCatalog,OutboxPlacement,ClaimOutbox,Events,BrokerCircuit,PublishResult,MarkPublished,Reschedule,OutboxIsolated,Stats system
    class Publish component
    class ContextFail,RecoveryFail,DispatchFail,FinalizeFail,OutboxFail error
